Forró Box @VERSION@ — macOS (universal: Apple Silicon and Intel)
@UNDERLINE@

Contents
  ForroBox.component   the Audio Unit instrument (a folder — copy the whole folder)
  ForroBox.vst3        the VST3 instrument (a folder — copy the whole folder)
  ForroBox.app         the standalone application
  LICENSE              GNU GPL v3 — source: https://github.com/dobidu/forrobox (tag @TAG@)
  NOTICE.md            third-party licences (JUCE, fonts, samples); font licences in licenses/

Requirements
  macOS 11 Big Sur or newer, on an Apple Silicon or an Intel Mac.

Install
  Audio Unit (Logic, GarageBand, MainStage, and most hosts):
    copy ForroBox.component into  ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/
  VST3 (Ableton Live, Reaper, Bitwig, Cubase...):
    copy ForroBox.vst3 into  ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/
  Standalone:
    copy ForroBox.app into  /Applications/
  Rescan plugins in your host. It is listed as "Forro Box" (no accent), an instrument.

Gatekeeper (important)
  These builds are signed ad hoc, not notarised by Apple, so macOS quarantines a downloaded copy
  and a host may refuse to load it. After copying, lift the quarantine in Terminal:
    xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/ForroBox.component
    xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/ForroBox.vst3
    xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/ForroBox.app
  For the app alone, Control-click it and choose Open once instead.
  A fresh instance loads CAMPINA GRANDE — press play.
